You must've eaten well today.

912
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:53,000
Just now.

913
00:24:53,580 --> 00:24:54,700
(Laughing from his joke)

914
00:24:54,800 --> 00:24:55,200
Good.

915
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:55,920
That hit was good.

916
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:56,440
Good.

917
00:24:57,040 --> 00:24:57,520
Nice.

918
00:24:57,520 --> 00:24:58,840
Two talented players.

919
00:24:58,840 --> 00:24:59,380
(Praises)

920
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:02,400
I'm so bad.

921
00:25:02,760 --> 00:25:03,240
It's fine.

922
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:04,000
Not at all.

923
00:25:09,860 --> 00:25:11,220
(Choose to quit)
Who wants to play?

924
00:25:11,300 --> 00:25:12,220
(Waves)

925
00:25:12,220 --> 00:25:13,080
You guys play.

926
00:25:13,080 --> 00:25:13,680
Let me.

927
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:14,360
Here.

928
00:25:14,680 --> 00:25:15,640
You're not playing?

929
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:16,560
Yeah. You play.

930
00:25:17,040 --> 00:25:18,760
Your whole body
should be around this position.

931
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:19,480
Around...

932
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,520
I can't really say what angle it is,

933
00:25:20,520 --> 00:25:21,360
But try to hit it at the highest point.

934
00:25:21,360 --> 00:25:21,680
Okay.

935
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,320
Reach for it.

936
00:25:22,800 --> 00:25:24,000
Go easy on me, okay?

937
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:25,040
Go easy on me.

938
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:26,360
You go easy on me.

939
00:25:26,360 --> 00:25:27,000
I'll start.

940
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,240
So high up.

941
00:25:30,780 --> 00:25:32,020
(Laughs)

942
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:33,760
I told you to go easy on me.

943
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:39,560
Does this mean you want me

944
00:25:39,560 --> 00:25:40,600
to catch it?

945
00:25:40,660 --> 00:25:41,150
I will...

946
00:25:41,800 --> 00:25:43,000
It's for you.

947
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:44,200
For the judge.

948
00:25:50,360 --> 00:25:51,560
Let me pass first.

949
00:25:57,560 --> 00:25:58,360
Looks like your skills

950
00:25:58,360 --> 00:25:59,600
are better than mine.

951
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:00,560
No.

952
00:26:02,020 --> 00:26:03,500
(Hits the roof)

953
00:26:11,160 --> 00:26:13,000
You really like that roof, huh?

954
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:16,960
Anyone want to play?

955
00:26:17,320 --> 00:26:18,120
Here.

956
00:26:18,920 --> 00:26:19,920
I'll take a break.

957
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:21,440
It's just exercise anyway.

958
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,320
Let's play.

959
00:26:22,320 --> 00:26:23,160
The two of you.

960
00:26:23,520 --> 00:26:24,560
Take a break.

961
00:26:36,040 --> 00:26:37,240
A master.

962
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,280
A hidden expert.

963
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:40,520
Me?

964
00:26:40,520 --> 00:26:41,640
You call that a hidden expert?

965
00:26:41,640 --> 00:26:42,880
You must've practiced your swing.

966
00:26:42,880 --> 00:26:43,640
You've all learned.

967
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,920
You even know backhand shots.

968
00:26:45,600 --> 00:26:47,000
You can play backhand?

969
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:47,760
I used to play,

970
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:49,160
but it's been too long since I played.

971
00:26:49,600 --> 00:26:51,040
I only know how to do this.

972
00:26:51,040 --> 00:26:51,760
Me too.

973
00:26:51,760 --> 00:26:53,200
I only know this.

974
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:54,640
But your drop shots are accurate.

975
00:26:54,640 --> 00:26:55,560
(Praise)
If you hadn't learned,

976
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:56,000
you wouldn't

977
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:56,640
be able to drop it

978
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:57,400
so steadily.

979
00:26:58,440 --> 00:26:59,120
Drop what?

980
00:26:59,120 --> 00:27:00,160
You have a good sense of space.

981
00:27:00,720 --> 00:27:01,720
The space is only so big,

982
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,160
but you can get it over.

983
00:27:06,860 --> 00:27:08,460
(Looks)

984
00:27:10,520 --> 00:27:12,480
You can tell they're professional.

985
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:13,440
Yes.

986
00:27:14,140 --> 00:27:14,860
(Trips)

987
00:27:15,360 --> 00:27:16,160
Careful.

988
00:27:16,160 --> 00:27:17,440
He went out.

989
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,160
You want me

990
00:27:18,160 --> 00:27:18,880
to fall into the river,

991
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:19,400
huh?

992
00:27:36,510 --> 00:27:39,230
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

993
00:27:39,230 --> 00:27:41,830
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

994
00:27:41,830 --> 00:27:46,030
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

995
00:27:47,190 --> 00:27:49,910
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

996
00:27:49,910 --> 00:27:52,550
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

997
00:27:52,550 --> 00:27:56,630
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

998
00:27:57,350 --> 00:27:58,750
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

999
00:27:58,750 --> 00:28:00,070
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

1000
00:28:00,070 --> 00:28:01,390
♪Love out loud♪

1001
00:28:01,390 --> 00:28:02,790
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

1002
00:28:02,790 --> 00:28:04,030
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

1003
00:28:04,030 --> 00:28:05,430
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

1004
00:28:05,430 --> 00:28:08,390
♪Just be a little braver♪

1005
00:28:08,390 --> 00:28:09,630
♪Keep moving♪

1006
00:28:09,750 --> 00:28:11,230
♪Keep moving♪

1007
00:28:11,230 --> 00:28:14,590
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1008
00:28:16,950 --> 00:28:19,310
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

1009
00:28:29,750 --> 00:28:32,550
♪Keep moving♪

1010
00:28:32,550 --> 00:28:35,190
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

1011
00:28:35,190 --> 00:28:37,830
♪Go discover♪

1012
00:28:37,830 --> 00:28:40,510
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

1013
00:28:40,510 --> 00:28:43,190
♪Come closer♪

1014
00:28:43,190 --> 00:28:46,590
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1015
00:28:49,030 --> 00:28:51,830
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪
